WEBVTT

00:00:00.108 --> 00:00:05.898
Assigning students to routes

00:00:05.948 --> 00:00:10.321
Open Transport and Assignments, then press New Assignment.

00:00:20.561 --> 00:00:25.894
Search for each student and click the name. You can add several at once.

00:00:36.112 --> 00:00:40.861
Choose the route, then the stop. The vehicle is optional.

00:00:47.165 --> 00:00:52.814
Press Assign. Both students now appear in the list with their stop and times.

00:00:58.332 --> 00:01:03.011
Students assigned
